#: includes/options/typography.php:177
msgid "Set your global typography sets. The sets defined here can be used from other global options, and element options. Each of the options within these sets can be individually overridden in options using the sets. <strong>IMPORTANT NOTE:</strong> If a global set that is used by other options gets deleted, these corresponding options will display the default font. Typography sets are internally stored with a fixed counter. Thus, adding a new set after deleting an old one, will set the same internal name to the new set."
msgstr "设置全局版式集。此处定义的集可以从其他全局选项和元素选项中使用。可以使用这些集中的选项在选项中单独覆盖这些集合中的每个选项。 <strong>重要提示：</strong> 如果删除了其他选项使用的全局集，则这些相应的选项将显示默认字体。排版集在内部存储一个固定的计数器。因此，在删除旧集后添加新集，将为新集设置相同的内部名称。"

#: includes/options/typography.php:176
msgid "Typography Sets"
msgstr "排版集"

#: includes/options/social_media.php:50
msgid "<strong>IMPORTANT NOTE:</strong> This tab controls the social networks that display in legacy headers and footers. Custom icons created here can also be used in the Social Links and the Person element."
msgstr "<strong>重要提示：</strong>此选项卡控制在旧版页眉和页脚中显示的社交网络。此处创建的自定义图标也可用于社交链接和个人元素。"

#: includes/options/performance.php:73
