msgstr "为网站的iframe选择您喜欢的延迟加载方法，以提高性能。"

#: includes/options/performance.php:72
msgid "Iframe Lazy Loading"
msgstr "Iframe延迟加载"

#: includes/options/colors.php:42
msgid "Set your global color palette. The colors defined here can be used from other global options, from page options and element options. For best results, the 8 colors of the core palette should be set from lightest to darkest. <strong>IMPORTANT NOTE:</strong> If a global color that is used by other options gets deleted, these corresponding options will display a default color instead. Colors are internally stored with a fixed counter. Thus, adding a new color after deleting an old one, will set the same internal name to the new color."
msgstr "设置全局调色板。此处定义的颜色可以从其他全局选项（页面选项和元素选项）中使用。为获得最佳效果，核心调色板的 8 种颜色应按从最亮到最暗的顺序进行设置。 <strong>重要提示：</strong> 如果删除了其他选项使用的全局颜色，则这些相应的选项将显示默认颜色。颜色在内部存储一个固定的计数器。因此，在删除旧颜色后添加新颜色，会将相同的内部名称设置为新颜色。"

