msgid "<strong>IMPORTANT NOTE:</strong> The options in this section will help to easier comply with data privacy regulations, like the European GDPR. When the \"Privacy Consent\" option is used, Avada will create a cookie with the name <b>\"privacy_embeds\"</b> on user clients browsing your site to manage and store user consent to load the different third party embeds and tracking scripts. You may want to add information about this cookie to your privacy page."
